# DarDesign frontend environment
#
# The backend is a FastAPI service (POST /redesign) exposed through an ngrok
# tunnel. The tunnel URL ROTATES EVERY SESSION — copy this file to `.env.local`
# and paste the current URL below (no trailing slash). Read by src/lib/api.ts,
# which falls back to http://localhost:8000 when this is unset.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-current-subdomain.ngrok-free.dev
